Z||000002||L.I. Fieros||09-06-2001||12:39 AM||||Update -- Well, it seems that the Fiero Store has been unable to get them since December of 2000.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> And Rodney unfortunately does not list them on his web site.  NAPA online lists an Echlin injector for $65.  However, much like Parts.com from another post, who knows if they can get it or not.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif"> Has anyone ever used an Echlin injector before?  The original is a Bosch unit.  Guess I'll keep looking.<P>What lies below is one mans attempt at displaying an image within an otherwise boring signature...<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>_______________________<BR>Long Island Fiero Enthusiasts<P>http://www.fiero.nl/fieroforum.pip||||reg||1
