Z||000010||87GTZ34||09-06-2001||06:32 PM||||Do you need the injector or the switch?  It only pumps in gas during crank but you drive your car in the 'dead' of winter, you will need for it to be working.  As Terry mentioned, you can pull those from other cars and they are in abundance in the 'yards'.  Only problem is that if it doesn't work, you have to go thru the hassel to pull and install another one.||||reg||1
